    MUST `s 810.02(8) specify how the things and authorizations are to be surrendered`

-- 810.02(9) A provincial court judge may, on application of the informant or the defendant, vary the conditions fixed in the recognizance.
-- src:16953 | Variance of conditions
-- src:16954 | (9) A provincial court judge may, on application of the informant or the defendant, vary the conditions fixed in the recognizance.
